{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09408","headline":"寓居永定精舍 · 韦应物","name":"寓居永定精舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"政拙忻罢守，闲居初理生。\n家贫何由往，梦想在京城。\n野寺霜露月，农兴羁旅情。\n聊租二顷田，方课子弟耕。\n眼暗文字废，身闲道心精。\n即与人羣远，岂谓是非婴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}